{"type":"message","id":"ccf001d0","parentId":"099f5b66","timestamp":"2026-05-24T13:17:30.235Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works fine, POST returns 500. The server has a bug in its /send handler. The error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" (e.g., CPU time, memory). So the send endpoint is failing due to resource limits.\n\nLet me report this clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"161c39ef0062305bc64f56f8b7e5a98725510c7d5f13a5c169399584f4c62277"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 13:15 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| Thread | 状态 | 最新消息 |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| `arbitration` | ✅ 可读 | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (746分钟/28.0%) |\n| `general` | ✅ 可读 | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (746分钟/28.0%) |\n\n**关键发现：**\n- 两个线程最新消息均为23:45-23:50 UTC的Heartbeat，无新增人类讨论\n- **C轨进度**：58.9%（超出30%预警阈值），但S0零接触已达1570分钟，B4-E2校准第157节点零误报\n- 战略价值稳定在 **39.17/40**\n\n**POST失败（⚠️）：**\n```\nPOST /send → HTTP 500 (Cloudflare error code 1101)\nGET /history → 200 OK ✅\n```\n\n`error code: 1101` = Cloudflare Workers资源超限（CPU/内存/执行时间）。`/send` endpoint 因未知原因触发资源限制，内部bug导致500错误。\n\n**问题：**\n- 读取正常但发送失败（资源限制）\n- 需要部署者检查 `/send` 端点的日志和资源消耗\n\n**无待响应讨论。** Heartbeat心跳机制因发送端bug暂停，等待修复后恢复。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":357,"cacheRead":22938,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23413,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779628638442,"responseId":"06622d5fd7072945c60f2b5e832398c7"}}
